# The repository routes *.csv through Git LFS for the large datasets. These
# daily bars are 230 KB, are packaged with the library, and every test reads
# them -- and actions/checkout does not fetch LFS content, so under LFS CI
# receives a pointer file and nothing loads.
#
# The 127 MB minute file in data/ stays in LFS; it is the raw source and no
# test touches it.
src/btc_forecast/data/*.csv -filter -diff -merge text
